### Contoh request untuk extension VS Code "REST Client".
### Klik tulisan "Send Request" yang muncul di atas setiap request.

@base = http://localhost:3000/api
# Isi dengan token dari hasil login
@token = TEMPEL_TOKEN_DI_SINI

### Daftar post (publik)
GET {{base}}/posts?page=1&per_page=5

### Detail post (publik)
GET {{base}}/posts/1

### Register
POST {{base}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Budi",
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "password": "rahasia123",
  "password_confirmation": "rahasia123"
}

### Login
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "password"
}

### Data user yang login
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buat post
POST {{base}}/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Post dari API",
  "body": "Isi post yang dibuat lewat REST API."
}

### Ubah post
PUT {{base}}/posts/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Judul baru",
  "body": "Isi baru yang cukup panjang."
}

### Hapus post
DELETE {{base}}/posts/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Logout (hapus token)
POST {{base}}/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
